---
config:
  theme: redux-dark-color
  look: neo
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Player
    participant Web as Pika-8 Web
    participant API as Refund API
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant Library as LibraryService

    Player ->> Web: requestRefund(gameId)
	  activate Web

	  Web ->> API: submitRefundRequest(userId, gameId, token)
	  activate API

		API ->> Auth: validateUser(token)	
		Auth -->> API: userValidated()

		API ->> Library: getTransactionAndLibrary(userId, gameId)
		activate Library
		Library -->> API: return(transactionId, purchaseDate, playTime)
		deactivate Library

		opt current_date - purchaseDate > 31 days
        API ->> API: validatePurchaseDate(purchaseDate)
				Note right of API: Failure: Purchase was made more than 31 days ago
				API -->> Web: 403 Forbidden {reason: "Time limit exceeded"}
		end

    Web -->> Player: showError("Refund rejected: Time limit exceeded")
    deactivate Web